cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "pbcheck: an auditor of pseudoreplication in single-cell RNA-seq differential expression"
message: "If you use this software or its Phase 0 protocol, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Poliakov
    given-names: Alexander
    email: s4s4spol@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/s4s4s4s/pbcheck"
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-07
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22557144
abstract: >-
  pbcheck estimates how much an existing single-cell RNA-seq differential-expression
  analysis is inflated by pseudoreplication, treating individual cells as independent
  replicates when the true unit of replication is the donor. v0.1.0 is the single-stratum
  audit tool; Phase 0, a pre-registered measurement study, continues alongside it; its frozen
  protocol is in docs/PHASE0_SPEC.md and every deviation is recorded in docs/AMENDMENTS.md.
keywords:
  - single-cell
  - scRNA-seq
  - differential-expression
  - pseudoreplication
  - pseudobulk
  - statistics
  - reproducibility
